message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Logistics support agent: a demo of polycog cognition"
abstract: >-
  A conversational logistics support agent for a small carrier company. A language model understands what the human
  says, while a world graph, a reasoner, and a search planner work out the cheapest way to deliver a shipment and
  what it costs. Built with polycog cognition.
authors:
  - name: Polycog
repository-code: "https://github.com/polycog/demo-logistics-tech"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - cognitive agents
  - conversational agents
  - planning
  - logistics
  - large language models
  - polycog cognition
